the end of the year and Quinn is jealous. They are going out tonight and Kyle is going to ask his brother to get them vodka and cigarettes. Quinn is going to meet Kirsty at the club.\nDialogue:  Alex: I'm going to the cinema tonight. Do you want to come with me?\r\nLily: I'd love to, but I have to work tonight.\r\nAlex: I'm going to the cinema tonight. Do you want to come with me?\r\nLily: I'd love to, but I have to work tonight.\r\nAlex: I"}
