 off on it. Kirsten will take input from Jamie and John. Larry wants to see a menorah in the lobby next year.\n\nDialogue: Laura: I'm going to the gym tomorrow. Do you want to come with me?\r\nLiz: I'm not sure. I have a lot of work to do.\r\nLaura: You can do it later. It's not like you"}
